  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/55b003cc882b4bef875bc376c627096b1472cbaa6b2903154fa731021fd64ca5.png] \n\nGiven equation: 36 × 11 ÷ 3 - 10 + 4 = 49\n\nOption 1) 10 and 4\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 36 × __**11 ÷ 3**__ - 4 + 10 = 49\n\n⇒ __**36 × **____3.67__ - 4 + 10 = 49\n\n⇒ **__132__** - 4 __**+ 10**__ = 49\n\n⇒ __142__**__ - 4__ **= 49\n\n⇒ 138 = 49\n\n**Option 2) 4 and 11**\n\n**After interchange the numbers:**\n\n⇒ 36 × __**4 ÷ 3**__ - 10 + 11 = 49\n\n⇒ __**36 × 1.33**__ - 10 + 11 = 49\n\n⇒ __48__ - 10 __**+ 11**__ = 49\n\n⇒ __**59**____** - 10**__ = 49\n\n⇒ 49 = 49\n\n**L.H.S = R.H.S**\n\nOption 3) 49 and 36\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 49 × __**11 ÷ 3**__ - 10 + 4 = 36\n\n⇒ __**49 × **____3.67__ - 10 + 4 = 36\n\n⇒ **__179.83__** - 10 __**+ 4**__ = 36\n\n⇒ __183.83____** - 10**__ = 36\n\n⇒ __173.83__ = 36\n\nOption 4) 11 and 3\n\nAfter interchange the numbers:\n\n⇒ 36 × __**3 ÷ 11**__ - 10 + 4 = 49 \n\n⇒ __**36 × 0.27**__ - 10 + 4 = 49\n\n⇒ __9.72__ - 10 __**+ 4**__ = 49 \n\n⇒ __13.72 - 10__ = 49 \n\n⇒ 3.72 = 49 \n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 2\".**",
